          <zone fixed-size='79' friendly-name='Footer' h='4938' id='54' is-fixed='true' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='89286' x='5357' y='90400'>
            <zone fixed-size='65' h='4938' id='55' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='89286' x='5357' y='90375'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4938' id='57' type-v2='text' w='89286' x='5357' y='90375'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontalignment='2'>
PROJECT: OCI 2023 (Published Sep 01, 2023)
PROJECT TEAM: VENDOR SALES &amp; OPERATIONS </run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='padding-right' value='5' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#d2dbe267' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='75' />
            <format attr='margin-top' value='50' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='12600' hidden-by-user='true' id='294' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='89500' x='5143' y='4950'>
          <zone h='12600' hidden-by-user='true' id='295' param='Image/First Section Annotationfirst section annotation.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='89500' x='5143' y='4950'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#d4d4d4db' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='14225' hidden-by-user='true' id='297' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='89857' x='5143' y='5075'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14225' hidden-by-user='true' id='298' type-v2='text' w='89857' x='5143' y='5075'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>This Section is about the overall vendor distrbution into 3 different buckets of </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Competitor Gap, Shared Vendors, DH Only Vendors</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> for the latest month and the evolution over time. This is important to evaluate the universe size changes per market and how much of the gap remains to be acquired and what cannot be acquired.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Let&apos;s try to understand them briefly:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>1. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Competitor Gap:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> These are vendors that are on the competitor platforms but inactive on DH platforms of the region. The competitor gap is the sum total of the addressable as well as non addressable gap. A non addressable gap is defined as a gap that was created by a vendor that is no longer on the DH platform due to its lost reason being closure, invalidity, duplicacy, delivery service issues or delivery area issues.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>2. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18' underline='true'>DH Only Vendors:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> These are vendors that are </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Active</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> and  </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>only</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> available on the </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>DH platform</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> and </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>not</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> on competitor platforms basis  the competitor list being defined by us. For each market&apos;s competitor List please refer to the competitor Gap deepdive View in </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Section 3</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>3. </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Shared Vendors:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'> These are vendors that are Active and  available on the DH platform and also on competitor platforms basis  the competitor list being defined by us. For each market&apos;s competitor List please refer to the Competitor Gap deepdive view in </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>Section 3.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#d4d4d4f2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='14725' hidden-by-user='true' id='302' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='89429' x='5214' y='21250'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14725' hidden-by-user='true' id='303' type-v2='text' w='89429' x='5214' y='21250'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>This Section is about the overall DH vendor Inventory trend between what is available only on DH or shared between what we define as a competitor in a market. This is important to evaluate how the inventory size inside DH keeps changing and how big of an impact is present on vendors making big orders with review buckets being the proxy of that.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>A further breakdown of the view based on GMV and Order Bucket size can also be explored at a Region-Entity Level to look at monthly behaviors. Vendor share with 0 orders in a month form the proxy for zombies in that month.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18' italic='true'>Remember the review buckets here are the reviews that we see on the DH platforms internally.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
