            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>This Section is about the overall Gap to Competition based on Competitors defined per Region-Entity. This is further broken down to addressable and non addressable gap which then can be visualised over time here.  </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18' italic='true'>Remember the review buckets here are the reviews that we see on the Competitor platforms scraped, furthermore the Review Velocity Bucket seen here are based on L4W period changes.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
