            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>This Section is about the overall Gap to Competition for the latest month data. This is further broken down by custom selections for geography level to expand the view to, and selective rows - columns that can be controlled directly using the filter selection.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18' italic='true'>Remember the review buckets here are the reviews that we see on the Competitor platforms scraped, furthermore the Review Velocity Bucket seen here are based on L4W period changes over the competitor reviews.</run>
